# Phase 2 — Explanation Tool, Reporting Tool & End-to-End Verification

## Summary
Completed Build Phase 2 by implementing the Explanation Tool (`ExplanationTool`), Reporting Tool (`ReportingTool`), and running complete verification across all tools.
The Explanation Tool provides evidence-grounded pattern template generation with a regex numeric preservation guardrail (`verify_numeric_preservation`) to guarantee zero numeric drift in downstream explanations.
The Reporting Tool assembles the canonical structured `AgentResponse` containing `query_id`, `raw_query`, `intent`, `execution_summary` (`tools_invoked`, `tools_skipped`, duration), `flagged_items` (`FlaggedItem`), supporting chart file paths, summary metrics, and executive summary narrative.
An end-to-end multi-tool pipeline test (`test_end_to_end_tool_pipeline`) was executed verifying seamless sequential execution from Data Query through Reporting.

